posts.text:
@bfrist is right. Vaccines should NOT be a political issue. We should be focused on protecting children and keeping Americans healthy.

Senator Dr. Frist and I have seen firsthand that vaccines save lives. Vaccines prevent infection in the person vaccinated, which also helps protect others who are vulnerable, such as infants too young to be vaccinated and people with weakened immune systems, including some cancer patients.

We have a responsibility to put evidence ahead of politics.

